Soliloquy (sold) is an optional Alpenglow session from https://github.com/tschk/soliloquy.

This tree does not vendor Soliloquy. To use the internet role:

  ALPENGLOW_EDITION=internet
  stage sold into /usr/local/bin/sold (or /usr/bin/sold)

dinit unit: /etc/dinit.d/sold
wrapper: /usr/local/bin/sold-session-start

Alpenglowed remains the default desktop session. sold does not replace it in this repo.
